# AI/LLM API call batching

- **Look for opportunities to batch calls.** When sending multiple items to an AI API, consider grouping them into a single prompt and requesting a structured response (e.g. a JSON object keyed by ID).
- **Batching benefits:** reduces rate limit exposure, cuts latency, and makes better use of the context window.
- **Batching is not always the right choice.** Avoid it when items are interdependent (the response for one informs the next), when the batch would exceed context limits, or when partial failure handling becomes overly complex.
